# On/Off/2h/10h parsed as NEC. Mode/Auto/30m/5h were saved as raw NEC
# repeat bursts only (~9.1 ms + ~2.25 ms + ~560 µs, no command payload).
# Do not invent command bytes for those four keys.
#
# ON — Light on
